    "name": "Bloomberg EMSX Trading Brokers API",
    "description": "Bloomberg Execution Management System (EMSX) API provides programmatic access to Bloomberg's order and execution management platform. It enables automated order creation, routing, modification, and execution monitoring for equity, fixed income, futures, and options trading across global markets. The API supports order lifecycle management, broker selection, route management, and real-time fill notifications through the Bloomberg Terminal and B-PIPE infrastructure.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Bloomberg Professional Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
